    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:44.208",
      "start": "00:04:17.083",
      "text": " Ngako ngapag rakya moka mag atnya ng ake"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:46.208",
      "start": "00:04:44.208",
      "text": " ...wag sa buw donton."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:49.208",
      "start": "00:04:46.208",
      "text": " We didn't know what to expect in the end."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:54.208",
      "start": "00:04:49.208",
      "text": " Lots of people come up and it's always a surprise effect."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:01.208",
      "start": "00:04:54.208",
      "text": " I make so many shows but the question if people will come and so on, it's still there."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:06.208",
      "start": "00:05:01.208",
      "text": " But anyway, there is always an off-road but still here in Saibou was crazy."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:10.208",
      "start": "00:05:06.208",
      "text": " People went nuts, amazing atmosphere, the locals don't ride around Tevis,"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:18.208",
      "start": "00:05:10.208",
      "text": " and throw down some epic tricks with his Duke and with joint forces in the end to make a cool show together."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:24.208",
      "start": "00:05:18.208",
      "text": " For me, amazing start of the tour gave me a lot of motivation."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:33.208",
      "start": "00:05:24.208",
      "text": " Now on the side of the shows we are shooting also a big movie from my tour with my team, with headlamps and his camera crew."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:38.208",
      "start": "00:05:33.208",
      "text": " We are going to make an amazing new movie for my YouTube channel RockBudderStoneT rider."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:42.208",
      "start": "00:05:38.208",
      "text": " And the next show starts on 11th February in Bakurot."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:45.208",
      "start": "00:05:42.208",
      "text": " So see you there my Filipinos and RockNroll."
    }
